1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,940
I usually start my basketball workouts with some stationary ball handling to get the blood flowing.
我通常先在原地练控球，让身体活动起来。

2
00:00:09,360 --> 00:00:14,020
Did not work on my ball handling on the move working on being more shifty.
然后练移动中的控球，让自己变向更灵活。

3
00:00:21,740 --> 00:00:27,060
Since I haven't been in the gym for a little bit I like to make sure I don't lose my fundamentals.
因为有一阵没来球馆，我想确保基本功不生疏。

4
00:00:27,060 --> 00:00:32,990
So we're doing some form shooting to keep the form straight.
所以要练练投篮动作，保持姿势。

5
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:34,680
Got to work on getting my touch back.
还得把手感找回来。

6
00:00:34,680 --> 00:00:40,020
So I'm gonna do a different variety of floaters off one off two just changing it up.
我要练几种抛投，单脚起跳、双脚起跳，换着来。

7
00:00:49,819 --> 00:00:52,140
Now it's time to put some socks up.
现在是时候开始投一些球了。

8
00:00:52,140 --> 00:01:03,120
I like to work on the move because it gives me the ability to loosen up and really get the sweating shots.
我喜欢边移动边练，这样能让身体放松开、真正出汗。

9
00:01:13,800 --> 00:01:18,120
Now I'm just looking to find the rhythm just making sure I can knock down as many shots as possible.
现在我要找节奏，尽量多投进一些球。

10
00:01:18,120 --> 00:01:23,430
Staying consistent making sure my form is good.
保持稳定，确保动作到位。

11
00:01:27,599 --> 00:01:31,979
After I get into pretty good rhythm with my cash and shoot I like to work off the dribble.
接球投篮进入节奏后，我会练运球后的投篮。

12
00:01:31,979 --> 00:01:38,490
Just making sure I'm doing quick moves and deepening my back.
确保动作快一点，继续丰富自己的进攻办法。

13
00:01:42,680 --> 00:01:50,950
Then I'll really just work on making tough shots and challenging myself to be creative with my moves.
然后练有难度的投篮，挑战自己在动作上更有创意。

14
00:01:50,960 --> 00:01:58,440
And you know we got to end the workout with some free throws that's free money 350 these shots.
当然，要用罚球结束训练，这简直是白送的分；后面的数字和话语识别不清。

15
00:01:58,440 --> 00:02:03,350
No I did not only make one shot y'all see it.
不，我可不是只投进一个，你们看到了。

16
00:02:03,360 --> 00:02:07,130
Daily work man daily work.
每天都练，兄弟，每天都练。

17
00:02:07,140 --> 00:02:09,540
Look make sure y'all boys are keeping wipes with you man.
听着，兄弟们一定要随身带湿巾。

18
00:02:09,540 --> 00:02:13,020
Gotta care about your hygiene you can't be walking around musty after a workout.
得注意个人卫生，运动完可不能浑身汗味地到处走。

19
00:02:13,020 --> 00:02:17,400
Just in case you got to go to class or somewhere and keep a stick of deodorant with you too.
万一还要去上课或别的地方，也带上一支除臭剂。

20
00:02:17,400 --> 00:02:21,380
Come on man can't be musty.
来吧，兄弟，可不能臭烘烘的。

21
00:02:34,799 --> 00:02:38,330
I haven't really been in the gym like that so it's good to be back.
我有一阵没怎么来球馆了，回来感觉真好。

22
00:02:38,340 --> 00:02:40,020
It's good to feel that little bird in your chest.
重新感受到胸口那种感觉很不错。

23
00:02:40,020 --> 00:02:41,880
Just gotta get back to being consistent.
得重新保持规律。

24
00:02:41,880 --> 00:02:59,250
But yeah man we about to head back got some more work to do so stay tuned thank you.
好了，我们准备回去，还有工作要做，继续看吧，谢谢。

25
00:03:03,860 --> 00:03:09,930
Now it's time to take a shower after putting in some pain.
现在练完这一场，该洗个澡了。

26
00:03:21,119 --> 00:03:29,270
You put in a lot of work so it's only right we get a good meal on us replace those calories we just burned.
刚才付出了不少，该好好吃一顿，补回消耗的热量了。

27
00:03:29,280 --> 00:03:33,360
Y'all know we stay with the good eats man you feel me.
你们知道，我们一向吃得不错，懂吧。

28
00:03:33,360 --> 00:03:38,330
Some chicken some broccoli asparagus told you we staying healthy with it man.
鸡肉、西兰花、芦笋；我就说吧，我们在好好吃饭。
